    {
      "id": "presentation-demo-intro",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "Presentation fields",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 320
      },
      "width": 900,
      "height": 260,
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Presentation fields\n\n**A draft, for Michael to try.** Each node below changes how it looks with one or two fields from the authoring contract, and says which. Select one and open **Presentation** or **Style** on the panel; change the value and the node follows. Clear a field and its default answers again.\n\nRows: colour, type, geometry, and what shows. The last node uses several at once."
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "presentation-demo"
        }
      }
    },
